<div class="ai-image-page">
	<h1 class="ai-image-title"><%= page.title %></h1>
	<p class="ai-image-intro">
		基于 Cloudflare Workers AI 的免费文生图。写好提示词、挑一个模型，点「生成图像」，几秒到几十秒后就能拿到图。
		生成过程只发生在你的浏览器和 Cloudflare 的边缘节点之间，这个页面不保存任何东西，图片要自己下载留档。
	</p>

	<form class="ai-image-form">
		<div class="ai-image-card">
			<div class="ai-image-field ai-image-password-field">
				<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-password">访问密码</label>
				<input id="ai-image-password" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="请输入访问密码" />
			</div>

			<div class="ai-image-field">
				<div class="ai-image-label-row">
					<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-prompt">正向提示词</label>
					<button type="button" class="ai-image-btn is-ghost ai-image-random">随机提示词</button>
				</div>
				<textarea id="ai-image-prompt" rows="4" placeholder="描述想要生成的图像内容与风格，例如：a lighthouse at dusk, minimal flat illustration"></textarea>
				<p class="ai-image-help">用英文描述通常效果更好。按 Ctrl / ⌘ + Enter 可以直接生成。</p>
			</div>

			<div class="ai-image-field">
				<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-negative">反向提示词</label>
				<textarea id="ai-image-negative" rows="2" placeholder="描述希望避免出现的元素，例如：blurry, watermark, extra fingers"></textarea>
			</div>

			<div class="ai-image-field">
				<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-model">文生图模型</label>
				<select id="ai-image-model">
					<option value="flux-1-schnell">FLUX.1 [schnell]</option>
				</select>
				<p class="ai-image-help ai-image-model-hint"></p>
			</div>

			<details class="ai-image-advanced" open>
				<summary>高级选项</summary>
				<div class="ai-image-grid">
					<div class="ai-image-field">
						<div class="ai-image-label-row">
							<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-width">图像宽度</label>
							<span class="ai-image-value" data-value-for="ai-image-width">1024</span>
						</div>
						<input id="ai-image-width" type="range" min="256" max="2048" step="64" value="1024" />
					</div>
					<div class="ai-image-field">
						<div class="ai-image-label-row">
							<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-height">图像高度</label>
							<span class="ai-image-value" data-value-for="ai-image-height">1024</span>
						</div>
						<input id="ai-image-height" type="range" min="256" max="2048" step="64" value="1024" />
					</div>
					<div class="ai-image-field">
						<div class="ai-image-label-row">
							<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-steps">迭代步数</label>
							<span class="ai-image-value" data-value-for="ai-image-steps">4</span>
						</div>
						<input id="ai-image-steps" type="range" min="1" max="20" step="1" value="4" />
						<p class="ai-image-help">更高的步数通常细节更足，但处理时间更长。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="ai-image-field">
						<div class="ai-image-label-row">
							<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-guidance">引导系数</label>
							<span class="ai-image-value" data-value-for="ai-image-guidance">7.5</span>
						</div>
						<input id="ai-image-guidance" type="range" min="0" max="30" step="0.5" value="7.5" />
						<p class="ai-image-help">控制生成结果与提示词的贴合程度，越高越严格。</p>
					</div>
					<div class="ai-image-field">
						<label class="ai-image-label" for="ai-image-seed">随机种子</label>
						<input id="ai-image-seed" type="number" min="0" max="1048575" placeholder="留空即随机" />
						<p class="ai-image-help">种子与参数都相同时，可以得到相近的图像。</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="ai-image-help">FLUX.1 [schnell] 只接受提示词和迭代步数（超出 4–8 会被服务端夹到区间内），其余参数它不理会。</p>
			</details>

			<div class="ai-image-actions">
				<button type="submit" class="ai-image-btn ai-image-submit">生成图像</button>
				<span class="ai-image-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</form>

	<div class="ai-image-card ai-image-output">
		<div class="ai-image-stage is-active" data-stage="empty">
			<div class="ai-image-placeholder">
				<p>生成的图像会出现在这里</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="ai-image-stage" data-stage="loading">
			<div class="ai-image-loading">
				<div class="ai-image-loading-bar"></div>
				<p>正在生成，请稍等…</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="ai-image-stage" data-stage="result">
			<img class="ai-image-result-img" alt="AI 生成的图像" />
			<div class="ai-image-result-bar">
				<span class="ai-image-meta"></span>
				<div class="ai-image-result-actions">
					<button type="button" class="ai-image-btn ai-image-download">下载</button>
					<button type="button" class="ai-image-btn is-ghost ai-image-open">新标签打开</button>
					<button type="button" class="ai-image-btn is-ghost ai-image-copy">复制参数</button>
					<button type="button" class="ai-image-btn is-ghost ai-image-again">再来一张</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="ai-image-stage" data-stage="error">
			<div class="ai-image-placeholder is-error">
				<p>这次没成功，看看上面的提示再试一次。</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<p class="ai-image-footer">
		算力由 Cloudflare Workers AI 提供，免费额度有限、请大家手下留情；模型自带安全过滤，生成结果是否合适、能不能用，还请自行判断。
	</p>
</div>

